Provenance
----------
The Yellowbrick v3 Bluetooth protocol implemented here is documented in
docs/PROTOCOL.md. It was established by interoperability analysis of the
vendor's discontinued Android app (no specification being otherwise
available), by HCI tracing and live exchanges with a real device, and by
offline analysis of its firmware. No vendor source code, binaries, resources
or documents are included in or were copied into this repository.

